    "details": "Denis Skvortsov, Security Researcher at Kaspersky reports:\n\n> xrdp before v0.10.5 contains an unauthenticated stack-based buffer\n> overflow vulnerability. The issue stems from improper bounds checking\n> when processing user domain information during the connection\n> sequence. If exploited, the vulnerability could allow remote attackers\n> to execute arbitrary code on the target system.\n",
